      "side": 1,
      "message": "To make the diffing a little easier (https://google.github.io/eng-practices/review/developer/small-cls.html), can you break out the changes related to the size into a separate commit that creates variables for the sizes?\n\nFor example,\n\n```\nconstexpr int encrypted_template_size \u003d FP_ALGORITHM_ENCRYPTED_TEMPLATE_SIZE;\n...\nr-\u003etemplate_size \u003d encrypted_template_size;\n```\n\n```\nconstexpr size_t algorithm_template_size \u003d sizeof(fp_buffer);\n...\nret \u003d validate_fp_buffer_offset(algorithm_template_size, offset, size);\n...\nuint8_t *positive_match_salt \u003d\n\t\t\tencrypted_template + algorithm_template_size;\n...\netc\n``` \n\nThen the diff in this CL will just be changing from something like:\n\n```\nr-\u003etemplate_size \u003d encrypted_template_size;\n```\n\nto\n\n```\nr-\u003etemplate_size \u003d fp_driver-\u003eencrypted_template_size;\n```\n\nwhich is a little easier to see is obviously correct.",
